<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Technical Data Sheet</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  td, th {
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .header-title {
    font-size: 24pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .section-heading {
    font-size: 14pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .sub-heading {
    font-size: 12pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .data-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .data-table th, .data-table td {
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .data-table th {
    background-color: #f2f2f2;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">
    <span data-field="company_name">{{ company_name }}</span>
  </div>
  <div style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">
    Technical Data Sheet
  </div>
  <div style="font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    Non-Metallic Systems
  </div>
  <div style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    Accessories - Nylon Locknuts - LNP - PG
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <img src="logo_placeholder.png" alt="Logo" style="width: 100px; height: auto; margin-right: 30px;">
    <div>
      <div class="section-heading">Nylon locknuts, to be used with non-metallic fittings when securing into knockouts</div>
      <div class="sub-heading">Features</div>
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px;">
        <li><span data-field="feature_1">{{ feature_1 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="feature_2">{{ feature_2 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="feature_3">{{ feature_3 }}</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <div class="section-heading">Conformity</div>
      <table class="data-table">
        <tr>
          <th style="width: 30%;"></th>
          <th style="width: 30%;"></th>
          <th style="width: 40%;"></th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>N/A</td>
          <td>N/A</td>
          <td></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <div class="section-heading">Fire Performance</div>
      <table class="data-table">
        <tr>
          <th style="width: 30%;"></th>
          <th style="width: 30%;"></th>
          <th style="width: 40%;"></th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Test Standard</td>
          <td><span data-field="fire_standard">{{ fire_standard }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="fire_rating">{{ fire_rating }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>BS EN 60695</td>
          <td><span data-field="fire_rating_2">{{ fire_rating_2 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="fire_rating_3">{{ fire_rating_3 }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>UL94</td>
          <td><span data-field="fire_rating_4">{{ fire_rating_4 }}</span></td>
          <td>V2</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td></td>
          <td>Self Extinguishing Low Smoke & Halogen Free</td>
          <td></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div style="width: 30%;">
        <div class="sub-heading">Degree of Mechanical Protection</div>
        <p><span data-field="mech_protection">{{ mech_protection }}</span></p>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">
        <div class="sub-heading">IP Rating</div>
        <p>For use with: see below</p>
        <p><span data-field="ip_rating">{{ ip_rating }}</span></p>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">
        <div class="sub-heading">UV Protection</div>
        <p><span data-field="uv_protection">{{ uv_protection }}</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <div class="sub-heading">Temperature Range</div>
      <p>Static Application: <span data-field="temp_static">{{ temp_static }}</span></p>
      <p>Dynamic Application: <span data-field="temp_dynamic">{{ temp_dynamic }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div style="width: 30%;">
        <div class="sub-heading">For Use With - Fitting Series</div>
        <p><span data-field="fitting_series">{{ fitting_series }}</span></p>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">
        <div class="sub-heading">Type of Material</div>
        <p><span data-field="material_type">{{ material_type }}</span></p>
        <p><span data-field="material_finish">{{ material_finish }}</span></p>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">
        <div class="sub-heading">Testing Data</div>
        <p><span data-field="testing_data">{{ testing_data }}</span></p>
        <p class="sub-heading">Fitting Characteristics</p>
        <p><span data-field="fitting_characteristics">{{ fitting_characteristics }}</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <table class="data-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style="width: 15%;">Part No Black</th>
          <th style="width: 15%;">Part No Grey</th>
          <th style="width: 20%;">Thread Size</th>
          <th style="width: 15%;">Nominal Dimensions (mm)</th>
          <th style="width: 15%;">A</th>
          <th style="width: 20%;">C</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for item in part_numbers %}
        <tr>
          <td><span data-field="part_numbers[{{ loop.index0 }}].part_no_black">{{ item.part_no_black }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="part_numbers[{{ loop.index0 }}].part_no_grey">{{ item.part_no_grey }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="part_numbers[{{ loop.index0 }}].thread_size">{{ item.thread_size }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="part_numbers[{{ loop.index0 }}].nominal_dimensions">{{ item.nominal_dimensions }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="part_numbers[{{ loop.index0 }}].dim_a">{{ item.dim_a }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="part_numbers[{{ loop.index0 }}].dim_c">{{ item.dim_c }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 60px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end;">
    <div>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">CMS House - Station Road - Coleshill - BA6 1HT - United Kingdom</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Sales Support tel: <span data-field="sales_phone">{{ sales_phone }}</span></p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Customer Service E-mail: <span data-field="customer_email">{{ customer_email }}</span></p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Technical Support E-mail: <span data-field="tech_email">{{ tech_email }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Power and productivity for a better world™</div>
      <img src="abb_logo_placeholder.png" alt="ABB Logo" style="width: 150px; height: auto; margin-top: 10px;">
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">
    <span data-field="company_name_2">{{ company_name_2 }}</span>
  </div>
  <div style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">
    Technical Data Sheet
  </div>
  <div style="font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    Non-Metallic Systems
  </div>
  <div style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    Accessories - Nylon Locknuts - LNP - PG
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="section-heading">Chemical Resistance Chart</div>
    <table class="data-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style="width: 15%;">Asm No.</th>
          <th style="width: 25%;">Chemical</th>
          <th style="width: 25%;">Result</th>
          <th style="width: 25%;">Chemical</th>
          <th style="width: 10%;">Key</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for row in chemical_resistance_data %}
        <tr>
          <td><span data-field="chemical_resistance_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].asm_no">{{ row.asm_no }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="chemical_resistance_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].chemical_1">{{ row.chemical_1 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="chemical_resistance_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].result_1">{{ row.result_1 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="chemical_resistance_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].chemical_2">{{ row.chemical_2 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="chemical_resistance_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].key">{{ row.key }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">The information above is given as a guide only and is based on published technical data and experience. The chemical resistance of the above products is dependent on factors such as chemical exposure, concentration of the chemical and temperature. The above chemicals are valid for a temperature of 23°C. Use of the above table is at the users own discretion and risk. Those using it must satisfy themselves that their application presents no health and safety risks. The end user should assess compatibility with their application and contact Thomas & Betts for further information.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 20px;">ADHERENCE TO THE CURRENT WIRING REGULATIONS BS7671 OR NEC WIRING REGULATIONS (FOR USA) IS STRONGLY ADVISED. MINIMUM BEND RADIUS FOR FLEXING IS DEPENDENT UPON MINIMUM TEMPERATURE, BENDING FREQUENCY AND CHEMICAL ENVIRONMENT.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 60px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end;">
    <div>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">CMS House - Station Road - Coleshill - BA6 1HT - United Kingdom</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Sales Support tel: <span data-field="sales_phone_2">{{ sales_phone_2 }}</span></p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Customer Service E-mail: <span data-field="customer_email_2">{{ customer_email_2 }}</span></p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Technical Support E-mail: <span data-field="tech_email_2">{{ tech_email_2 }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Power and productivity for a better world™</div>
      <img src="abb_logo_placeholder_2.png" alt="ABB Logo 2" style="width: 150px; height: auto; margin-top: 10px;">
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>